Rocinante, a layout for the Herdr app.

mods/rocinante-tabs is a modified copy of Herdr's shipped "tabs" mod
(Herdr 0.1.10): it draws a braille spinner for working tabs.

mods/rocinante-pane is a modified copy of Herdr's shipped "pane" mod
(Herdr 0.1.10): it draws a braille spinner for working agents.

layouts/rocinante.json started as a clone of Herdr's "main" layout (0.1.10).

